        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Simon Neil, Michael McKean, James Johnston, Ben Johnston\n- Organizations: Biffy Clyro\n- Products: \"Semi-Mental\", \"Puzzle\"\n- Places: Kilmarnock, East Ayrshire\n- Roles: vocalist, guitarist, songwriter, actor, comedian, musician, bassist, drummer\n\nFacts:\n- Michael McKean was born on October 17, 1947.\n- Michael McKean is an American actor, comedian, and musician known for a variety of roles played since the 1970s.\n- Simon Neil was born on 31 August 1979.\n- Simon Neil is a Scottish vocalist, guitarist, and songwriter.\n- Biffy Clyro is a Scottish rock band that formed in Kilmarnock, East Ayrshire.\n- Biffy Clyro is composed of Simon Neil on guitar and lead vocals, James Johnston on bass and vocals, and Ben Johnston on drums and vocals.\n- \"Semi-Mental\" is a song by Biffy Clyro.\n- \"Semi-Mental\" was the first single from Biffy Clyro's fourth album, \"Puzzle\", and it was released as a download-only single.",
